: {"steamid": "76561198044024894", "personaname": "Baka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044024894/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 3023, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1249, "last_played": 1706143230, "avatar": "4908605dced2ea33ceeda1965378d7df14b97532"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun Rougelite Robo FPS Shooter", "timestamp_created": 1701991187, "timestamp_updated": 1701991187, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153075794", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004625267", "personaname": "Ascate", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ascate/", "num_games_owned": 3807, "num_reviews": 335, "playtime_forever": 2608, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2295, "last_played": 1732978399, "avatar": "3b07b6a7ae3c4bb93d47c5e745e252209d84e666"}, "language": "english", "review": "Verdict: Roboquest is an Early Access title done right. RyseUp Studios released an amazing FPS Roguelite that is worth every cent. \n\n+\nSteam trading cards\nSteam achievements (76, 2 are difficulty based, 1 is grind based)\nA huge amount of weapons (73 and most of them feel unique)\nA vast variety of enemies (70), Elites (12) and bosses (10)\nQuite a lot of items that change your style, some being pure advantage (91) while others are advantage + disadvantage (24)\nSolid choice of paths to go through (16 in total and you go through 8 in a playthrough)\nActually, a solid coop code that doesn't crash \nClasses that are unique in perks, abilities and playstyle (6 in total, each has 16 perks with 32 additional subperks and ability + unique melee)\nPleasant soundtrack to listen to\nImmaculate art style where everything is communicated just right\n\n-\nIt is quite grindy to have a complete collection in the museum \nThe main camp feels lifeless. It would be nice to have traders and such chilling there between missions \nCoop doesn't have a lobby list \nI have encountered some minor bugs (e.g character forgot how to use a jetpack and my weapon went into the ground once when I picked another one as a drop)", "timestamp_created": 1701986780, "timestamp_updated": 1702033797, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.538279414176940918", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "153070853", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018775026", "personaname": "Mindboggles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Mindboggles/", "num_games_owned": 558, "num_reviews": 92, "playtime_forever": 417, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 387, "last_played": 1710504097, "avatar": "8ed276f8ad3190b50b2f5e34ea38d175efeb9a48"}, "language": "english", "review": "It feels like playing Borderlands, but with the benefit that you are not actually playing borderlands. \n\nIn all seriousness, it's very different from Borderlands, but it's the best I got atm. I like it.", "timestamp_created": 1701982643, "timestamp_updated": 1701982643, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153065022", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989270607", "personaname": "Razelluxe", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url