s looking for. Basically the RoR2 of FPS Roguelites.\n\nAlso that soundtrack SLAPS", "timestamp_created": 1701961397, "timestamp_updated": 1701961397, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153047636", "author": {"steamid": "76561197965575867", "personaname": "M249 SAW", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197965575867/", "num_games_owned": 242, "num_reviews": 78, "playtime_forever": 1821, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 496, "last_played": 1741225579, "avatar": "79f631969d7833f629bce46d99dad40d5da07619"}, "language": "english", "review": "I got a free steamkey, so this is coming from no idea what the game even was. I will say, me and a random dude on the internet that I am related to had the best time trying to beat the first boss fight for like a hour and a half, we suck at the game yet loved every second of it. 10/10, 20 bucks is worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1701959400, "timestamp_updated": 1704320681, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504960477352142334", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153044767", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139637257", "personaname": "I_Think_Its_Chris", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198139637257/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 569, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 409, "last_played": 1720610774, "avatar": "506179940dae3c2887965049c88600f21de6aa79"}, "language": "english", "review": "Robot", "timestamp_created": 1701955770, "timestamp_updated": 1701955770, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153042971", "author": {"steamid": "76561198983477487", "personaname": "Runica", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/s4uyh5e/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4897, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 202, "last_played": 1786099596, "avatar": "b2edbc430cffa963966ebafc9e7844414a9c51c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "this was my first roguelite and its my favorite game! i love it", "timestamp_created": 1701953281, "timestamp_updated": 1701953281, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153039583", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008749599", "personaname": "Rhizzy", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/donrade/", "num_games_owned": 1098, "num_reviews": 184, "playtime_forever": 2050, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1843, "last_played": 1737100606, "avatar": "4eaf6f8f0c5f059037c02c77557ca4abcfb6bd0c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Instantly becomes one of the all time great roguelikes. Most of the praise goes to the movement – it is super fast paced and engaging. I kept getting surprised each time a new mechanic was added to the arsenal. The combat is very fluid and satisfying. There is a good amount of variety combining abilities, perks, and guns, which keeps the game fresh. There are lots of secrets to unlock and discover. The cell shaded, comic book artstyle is also very cool. And can’t forget about the outstanding soundtrack that keeps getting better as you progress through the stages. \n\nMy only slight complaints would be:\n1. Stages and enemies not being very “roguelike” randomized. There are (I think) about 2 stage layouts and 2 patterns of enemy spawns, so after a while you get used to it and know what to expect.\n2. Lack of long term content. The ending seems rushed with last 3 stages not having the pathing choices like in the first half of the game. Initially it looks like there is so much to discover, but you can see everything game has to offer in about 20h (or less). Hopefully more content is being worked on for the future. It is not really a “hundreds of hours” kinda game. But that’s okay, not every game needs to be. The initial discovery phase is still quite phenomenal.", "timestamp_created": 1701948027, "timestamp_updated": 1701948027, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541984736919403076", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}